# Model environment guardrails

Reference: `docs/MODEL_ENV_GUARDRAILS.md`

## Enabling or adding a model

1. `config/models.yaml` + `model_factory.py` ADAPTER_REGISTRY
2. **`config/verify_profiles.yaml`** — required; preflight fails without it
3. `python scripts/verify_registry.py --validate`

## After any `pip install` into `3DAIGC-API/venv`

Use **`bash scripts/pip_main_venv.sh install …`** (applies constraints + post_pip_guard).

Or manually:
1. `bash scripts/post_pip_guard.sh`
2. Restart API: `./scripts/run_server.sh`

## Do not

- Raw `pip install -U transformers` / git diffusers on main `venv`
- Install Kimodo deps into main `venv` (use `.venv-kimodo` + `constraints-kimodo.txt`)
- Enable a model in `models.yaml` without a `verify_profiles.yaml` entry
- Skip restart after venv changes
- Duplicate `DinoV3FeatureExtractor` in `trellis2/modules/image_feature_extractor.py` (inference re-exports `image_conditioned.py`; layer access via `dinov3_encoder.get_dinov3_encoder_layers`)

## Verify tiers

| Tier | Command | When |
|------|---------|------|
| validate | `verify_registry.py --validate` | Every model add/enable |
| quick | `--tier quick --all-enabled` | API preflight (imports) |
| infer | `--tier infer --model ID` | Canary before ship |
| full | `verify_all_enabled_models.sh` | Weekly / release |

